en:{heading:"Before you go",intro:"{p} has been removed. If you have a moment, two short questions would help us make it better.",q1:"For continuous improvement, we would like to know why you uninstalled {p}.",q1Hint:"Check all that apply",optNotExpected:"It wasn't what I expected",optDontUnderstand:"I don't understand how to use it",optWantedInPage:"I would have liked an interface built into the site itself",optFoundBugs:"I ran into bugs",optOther:"Other",optSwitchedToAf:"I switched to {p}",otherPlaceholder:"Tell us more",q2:"Do you have any general comments for us?",q2Placeholder:"Optional",privacyTitle:"What gets sent",privacyBody:"Nothing leaves your device until you press Send. Your answer is anonymous and carries only: how long the extension was installed, its version, your browser, your language, and how many times you opened the popup.",submit:"Send",sending:"Sending…",thanksTitle:"Thank you",thanksBody:"Your feedback goes straight into the next version.",failTitle:"The message could not be sent",failBody:"A content blocker or your connection may have stopped it. You can copy your answer and send it to us on GitHub.",copyBtn:"Copy my answer",copiedBtn:"Copied"},
